== Research Interests
- *Signal Processing & Optimization:* Statistical signal processing, matrix analysis, and convex optimization. [projects.html#channel-estimation Channel estimation]
- *Beyond Massive MIMO:* Massive MIMO and holographic MIMO (H-MIMO). [projects.html#holographic-mimo Holographic MIMO] | [projects.html#near-field Near-field MIMO]
- *Intelligent Surfaces:* Reconfigurable intelligent surfaces (RIS) and large intelligent surfaces (LIS). [projects.html#intelligent-surfaces RIS research]
- *Localization & Robotics:* Ranging, network localization, navigation, unmanned aerial vehicles (UAVs), and robotics. [projects.html#localization-radio-maps Localization] | [demos.html Robotics demos]

== Academic Service
- Technical program committee member: IEEE GLOBECOM (2022, 2024), IEEE VTC (Fall 2022), and IEEE WCNC (2024, 2025).
- Journal reviewer: Nature Communications, IEEE JSAC, IEEE TIT, IEEE TSP, IEEE JSTSP, IEEE TCOM, IEEE TWC, IEEE Communications Magazine, and IEEE Vehicular Technology Magazine, among others.
- Conference reviewer: IEEE ICC, IEEE GLOBECOM, IEEE ISIT, IEEE ICASSP, IEEE VTC, IEEE WCNC, and IEEE SPAWC, among others.
